# Control

- Keep bindable properties and `State` (`Idle` / `Loading` / `Loaded` / `Failed`) consistent with existing behavior.
- UI updates on the UI thread. Use `LoadGenerationGuard` so stale loads cannot win races.
- Local sources go through MAUI `Image`; remote sources go through `IImageLoader`.
- Do not block the UI thread on HTTP or disk I/O.
